<title>USA: Oshkosh, Freightliner terminate alliance.</title>
<headline>Oshkosh, Freightliner terminate alliance.</headline>
<dateline>OSHKOSH, Wis. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oshkosh Truck Corp said it agreed with Freightliner Corp, a unit of Daimler-Benz AG, to a formal termination of their strategic alliance formed June 2, 1995.</p>
<p>Oshkosh said it will repurchase from Freightliner 350,000 shares of Class B common stock and 1.25 million warrants for the purchase of additional shares of Class B common stock for a total of $6.75 million.</p>
<p>The companies will continue to supply each other with parts and components, Oshkosh said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
